e/13948787/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-7698" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Our expression can be factored as follows:\n\n$$\n5(1-2{sin}^{2}⁡{20}^{∘})\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={20}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2{sin}^{2}⁡{20}^{∘} & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {20}^{∘})=\\operatorname{cos}⁡{40}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n5(1-2{sin}^{2}⁡{20}^{∘})=5\\operatorname{cos}⁡{40}^{∘}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/state.json" "file_sha256" "3a8484b8e96bb9ad1d23dd13ec360247c96845d6fa5803f133795e3d9042389f" "basis" 556 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-7698" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "38385a60601907b35689e519c2e0453a8d1508821e6860a3956ce5f6cd72e086" "basis" 556 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-7698" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/state.json" "file_sha256" "3a8484b8e96bb9ad1d23dd13ec360247c96845d6fa5803f133795e3d9042389f" "basis" 556 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the exact value of $1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘}).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/state.json" "file_sha256" "3a8484b8e96bb9ad1d23dd13ec360247c96845d6fa5803f133795e3d9042389f" "basis" 556 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={22.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {22.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/state.json" "file_sha256" "3a8484b8e96bb9ad1d23dd13ec360247c96845d6fa5803f133795e3d9042389f" "basis" 556 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "38385a60601907b35689e519c2e0453a8d1508821e6860a3956ce5f6cd72e086" "basis" 556 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13948787/state.json" "file_sha256" "3a8484b8e96bb9ad1d23dd13ec360247c96845d6fa5803f133795e3d9042389f" "basis" 556 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-captu