6" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={67.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {67.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{135}^{∘} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-26706" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6a6df37f14697ffad44d694f927c71ac8192e51adc7d53d7df050442bf270d71"} {"question" "q-26706" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-26706" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] ["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-26706" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the exact value of $1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘}).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={22.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {22.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6a6df37f14697ffad44d694f927c71ac8192e51adc7d53d7df050442bf270d71"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-7473" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-332150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-332150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, notice that our expression is a perfect square that can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}) & ={({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}))}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}) & =cos\\,(2\\cdot \\frac{7\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =cos\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}))}^{2} & ={(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})}^{2}=\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-332150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6a6df37f14697ffad44d694f927c71ac8192e51adc7d53d7df050442bf270d71"} {"question" "q-332150" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-332150" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{3}{4}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-120370" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the exact value of ${cos}^{2}⁡({157.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({157.5}^{∘}).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039198/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff865529cd1e353975032747b454336e536dcf6ab158595a80f7f271778caed6"} {"question" "q-120370" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={157.5}^{∘